    "body_html": "<h3><strong><iframe title=\"YouTube video player\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lIn1NaC54Tw\" height=\"315\" width=\"560\"></iframe></strong></h3>\n<h3><strong>25TH ANNIVERARY TRIBUTE</strong></h3>\n<p class=\"p1\">This is the 25th anniversary of the <strong>3-D Offset</strong>, and we are excited to pay tribute to one of the greatest balls ever. We started with the core shape, creating a single density inner core with the same shape as the original.</p>\n<h3><strong>BALL SPECS</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PERFORMANCE</strong><span> High</span></li>\n<li><strong>PART NUMBER</strong><span> 60-106714-93X</span></li>\n<li><strong>COLOR</strong><span> Blazing Violet</span></li>\n<li><strong>CORE</strong><span> High Rev Offset</span><br></li>\n<li><strong>CORE TYPE</strong><span> </span>Asymmetric<br></li>\n<li><strong>COVERSTOCK</strong><span> Neoflex 25</span></li>\n<li><strong>COVER TYPE</strong><span> Pearl</span> Reactive</li>\n<li><strong>FINISH</strong><span> 500, 2000 Siaair Micro Pad</span><br></li>\n<li><strong>WEIGHTS</strong><span> </span>16-12 Pounds<br></li>\n<li><strong>LANE CONDITION</strong><span> Medium to heavy </span>oil</li>\n<li><strong>WARRANTY</strong><span> </span>Two years from purchase date</li>\n<li><strong>RELEASE DATE</strong><span> February 25, 2022</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>RG / DIFF / ASY</strong></h3>\n<ul class=\"spec-weights\">\n<li><strong>16 lb -</strong><span> </span><strong>RG</strong><span> </span>(2.501)<span> </span><strong>DIFF</strong><span> </span>(0.046)<span> </span><strong>ASY</strong><span> </span>(0.007)</li>\n<li><strong>15 lb -</strong><span> </span><strong>RG</strong><span> </span>(2.489)<span> </span><strong>DIFF</strong><span> </span>(0.053)<span> </span><strong>ASY</strong><span> </span>(0.008)</li>\n<li><strong>14 lb -</strong><span> </span><strong>RG</strong><span> </span>(2.505)<span> </span><strong>DIFF</strong><span> </span>(0.053)<span> </span><strong>ASY</strong><span> </span>(0.008)</li>\n<li><strong>13 lb -</strong><span> </span><strong>RG</strong><span> </span>(2.589)<span> </span><strong>DIFF</strong><span> </span>(0.043)<span> </span><strong>ASY</strong><span> </span>(0.011)</li>\n<li><strong>12 lb -</strong><span> </span><strong>RG</strong><span> </span>(2.612)<span> </span><strong>DIFF</strong><span> </span>(0.043)<span> </span><strong>ASY</strong><span> </span>(0.011)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>DOWNLOADS</strong></p>\n<p><a title=\"3-D Offset Info Sheet\" href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0030/3330/1104/files/3-D_Offset_Info_Sheet_0122-02.pdf?v=1643032134\">Info Sheet</a><br><a title=\"3-D Offset Ball Talker\" href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0030/3330/1104/files/3-D_Offset_Ball_Talker_0122-01.pdf?v=1643032096\">Ball Talker</a><br></p>",
